# Netlify SPA rewrites: every route serves the app shell with HTTP 200 so
# deep links (/single-location/*, /business-profile/*, /signup, /download)
# cold-load directly. Human traffic always gets the SPA; the Phase 2 edge
# function only rewrites OG tags for crawler user-agents.
/single-location/*    /index.html   200
/business-profile/*   /index.html   200
/signup               /index.html   200
/download             /index.html   200
/*    /index.html   200
